      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it gets better... but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like i'm just waiting for the world to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone. there's no point in trying to \"fix\" it or talk to someone when the person who actually knew me is just... gone. like, what am i even supposed to be doing here alone? it just feels so pointless.",
